18. What Safe & Sane has become

The project began with a broad ambition around AI safety and human protection.

It has progressively become more precise:

Safe & Sane is now being investigated as a configuration-and-transition framework for preserving semantic integrity under dynamic coupling and adversarial change.

Its distinctive experimental objects are:

DOS
Dynamic Coupling
State
Lineage
Authority
Transition
Consequence
Trajectory
ASDE

RACT provides transition-oriented analysis.

The sandbox provides an execution environment.

GitHub Actions provides an observable workflow and event pathway.

Benchmarking provides integrity checks.

Adversarial perturbation provides stress.

ASDE provides the emerging candidate unit of semantic operation.

